# LedControl wakes the MAX7219 from shutdown, sets intensity 8, and draws the smiley.
open
expect @matrix off
# The sketch starts 66 ms after power-on, when the start from reset the fuses set is over.
step 116ms
expect @matrix lit
expect @matrix shows tests/matrix.screen
expect @matrix.brightness > 2mA
expect @matrix.brightness < 4mA
expect no diagnostics
